text = "2. SHARED-SOUL MORPH & RESONANCE"

[node name="MorphBody" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MarginContainer/VBoxContainer/HSplitContainer/RightCol"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 14
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b]ZERO-COOLDOWN MORPHING (Keys 1-4 / Q & E / D-Pad):[/b]
Morph instantly mid-combo! Preserves velocity, facing, and active combo state with 2 frames of hitstun immunity.

[color=#00D4FF][b][1] ENDOR (Asgardian):[/b][/color] Heavy armor-crusher, high poise, thunder hammer.
[color=#FFE066][b][2] IR (Olympian):[/b][/color] Flash-step rapier combos, Aegis riposte on parry.
[color=#2ECC71][b][3] OSIRIS (Egyptian):[/b][/color] Mid-range Duat crowd control, Soul Harvest HP siphon.
[color=#FF7A00][b][4] HORUS (Egyptian):[/b][/color] Aerial mobility, double-jump hover, dive juggles.

[b]CROSS-PANTHEON RESONANCE MULTIPLIER:[/b]
• 1 God: 1.00x Base Multiplier
• 2 Gods in combo: [color=#FFE066]1.75x Score Bonus[/color]
• 3 Gods in combo: [color=#2ECC71]2.75x Score Bonus[/color]
• 4 Gods in combo: [color=#FF1E8A]4.00x GODLIKE Cross-Pantheon Bonus![/color]"
